Fri Nov 20 06:23:47 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.0.22:
  * Add optional finish-reason fields to message-finish: raw
    finish_reason, normalized normalized_finish_reason (stop,
    length, tool_call, content_filter, refusal, context_exceeded,
    error, other) and finish_state (complete/suspended), so
    consumers can tell truncated or blocked turns from clean
    finishes without parsing provider values

